  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK International Search and Rescue Team component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Merseyside Fire Rescue Authority (MFRA) is the delivery partner for UK-ISAR. MFRA is a Public Body which holds the only &#x2018;heavy&#x2019; team classified by OCHA in the UK, as well as a DEFRA standard flood rescue (boat operations) team. 

The UK ISAR team is made up of active UK firefighters from 14 Fire and Rescue Services from across the UK, in addition to specially trained structural engineers, vets, search dogs and medics.</narrative>
  </description>
